            "html": "<article id=\"post-26511\" class=\"post-26511 post type-post status-publish format-quote hentry post_format-post-format-quote category-citacoes category-english category-filosofia tag-being-poor tag-cold-case tag-love tag-mom tag-money\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#citacoes\" rel=\"category\">Citações</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#english\" rel=\"category\">English</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#filosofia\" rel=\"category\">Filosofia</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"2019-09-20-maybe-its-not-enough-mom-love.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">Maybe it’s not enough, mom… Love</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#quote\">Citação</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"2019-09-20-maybe-its-not-enough-mom-love.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2019-09-20T13:05:53-03:00\">20/09/2019</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"2019-09-20-maybe-its-not-enough-mom-love.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#being-poor\" rel=\"tag\">Being Poor</a> <a href=\"tag.html#cold-case\" rel=\"tag\">Cold Case</a> <a href=\"tag.html#love\" rel=\"tag\">Love</a> <a href=\"tag.html#mom\" rel=\"tag\">Mom</a> <a href=\"tag.html#money\" rel=\"tag\">Money</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\"><blockquote><p>&#8211; I never thought I&#8217;d be a widow. I never thought I&#8217;d lose our home. Your dad always took care of everything. All I had to do was love you and your sister.</p>\n<p>&#8211; Maybe it&#8217;s not enough, mom&#8230; Love.</p>\n<p>&#8211; It&#8217;